  dialogueText: 'When you want someone to come along with you, you can tell them
    to follow.

    In Ilokano, ''surotennak'' means ''follow me.''

    Use it when
    leading someone to another place.

    Listen carefully: surotennak.

    Now,
    try saying ''surotennak'' yourself.'
